rapier-threads
Unofficial multi-threaded WebAssembly build of the Rapier physics engine.

This product includes software developed by Dimforge and the Rapier contributors
(https://github.com/dimforge/rapier), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Rapier is a trademark of its owners; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Dimforge.

Modifications made by this project (applied at build time to the generated build crate only):
  - enables the `parallel` and `unsync-callbacks` features of the rapier crate;
  - adds the `wasm-bindgen-rayon` dependency and exports `initThreadPool`;
  - compiles with WebAssembly threads (atomics, shared memory) and SIMD, with LTO, then runs wasm-opt;
  - replaces `raw.ts` and `init.ts` of the TypeScript bindings;
  - adds a small Vite plugin (vite.js) that serves the package files unmodified.

